    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d517">

                <pb facs="0615" n="531" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg531"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. Raikes.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-07-01"><hi rendition="#small-caps">July</hi> 1,
                        1903</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 153.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In accordance with the agreement between
                    the two governments as to the place of delivery of the counter case in the
                    Alaskan boundary dispute, I have the honor to deliver herewith by special
                    messenger the counter case of the United States, pursuant to provisions of
                    treaty, together with a communication from the agent of the United States to the
                    agent of Great Britain, which you are respectfully requested to transmit to the
                    latter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, sir,</p>
                <p>Your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis B. Loomis</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
